        "clothing#cap",
        "clothing#clothes",
        "clothing#tracksuit bottoms"
      ],
      "learn": [
        {
          "title": "What are you wearing?",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "Clothes = *les vêtements*. Watch the gender: *le pull, le blouson*, but *la jupe, la robe, la veste*. Learn every word with its article."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "textCols": [0],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "T-shirt",
                  "un T-shirt"
                ],
                [
                  "sweatshirt",
                  "un sweat-shirt (un sweat)"
                ],
                [
                  "jumper",
                  "un pull"
                ],
                [
                  "shirt",
                  "une chemise"
                ],
                [
                  "skirt",
                  "une jupe"
                ],
                [
                  "dress",
                  "une robe"
                ],
                [
                  "jacket",
                  "un blouson"
                ],
                [
                  "coat",
                  "un manteau"
                ],
                [
                  "shoes",
                  "des chaussures"
                ],
                [
                  "trainers",
                  "des baskets"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "Il fait froid, je prends mon ___.",
                "a": [
                  "manteau"
                ],
                "hint": "coat"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Trousers = un pantalon",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "title": "singular",
              "en": "As in English, *un pantalon* (trousers), *un jean* (jeans), *un short* (shorts) and *un jogging* (tracksuit bottoms) are one item, but in French they are **singular**: *Mon jean est bleu*, not *mes jeans sont bleus*."
            },
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "J'ai un nouveau jean.",
                  "en": "I have new jeans."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Ton pantalon est trop long.",
                  "en": "Your trousers are too long. (tu)"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Mon short est rouge.",
                  "en": "My shorts are red."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Où sont mes chaussettes ?",
                  "en": "Where are my socks?"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "build",
                "en": "My jeans are black.",
                "a": [
                  "Mon jean est noir."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Words",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "vocab"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
