    {
      "id": "fr-mode-4",
      "title": "Plus cher que...",
      "subtitle": "Comparing",
      "topics": [
        "comparative",
        "clothing"
      ],
      "words": [
        "clothing#too big"
      ],
      "learn": [
        {
          "title": "plus, moins, aussi",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "You compare like this: *plus* (more), *moins* (less), *aussi* (as) + adjective + *que*. The adjective agrees with what it describes: *Cette robe est plus chère que la jupe.*"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "textCols": [0],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "more expensive than",
                  "plus cher que"
                ],
                [
                  "cheaper than (less expensive)",
                  "moins cher que"
                ],
                [
                  "as expensive as",
                  "aussi cher que"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "Le manteau est ___ cher que le pull.",
                "a": [
                  "plus"
                ],
                "hint": "more expensive"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "better and best",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "title": "meilleur",
              "en": "*Bon* has no form *plus bon*; you say *meilleur* (feminine *meilleure*): *Ce jean est meilleur que l'autre.* For the adverb *bien* it's *mieux*: *Ça te va mieux.*"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The most = *le plus, la plus, les plus*: *C'est la robe la plus chère du magasin.* (It's the most expensive dress in the shop.)"
            },
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Les baskets sont plus confortables que les bottes.",
                  "en": "Trainers are more comfortable than boots."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Ma veste est moins chaude que ton manteau.",
                  "en": "My jacket is less warm than your coat."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Ton T-shirt est aussi joli que ma chemise.",
                  "en": "Your T-shirt is as nice as my shirt."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Cette robe te va mieux.",
                  "en": "This dress suits you better."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "build",
                "en": "This jacket is better.",
                "a": [
                  "Ce blouson est meilleur."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Words",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "vocab"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "practice": [
        {
          "id": "fr-mode-4-01",
